---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="About Westbrook Currents | Westbrook, Maine Community Events" description="Learn about Westbrook Currents, an independent community website for local events and help finding assistance in Westbrook, Maine." currentPage="about">
  <main class="about-wrap">
    <article class="about-content">
      <header class="profile-section">
        <img class="profile-photo" src="/gerry-westbrook-currents-about.webp" alt="Gerry, founder and editor of Westbrook Currents" />
        <div class="profile-heading">
          <p>Founder &amp; Editor</p>
          <h1>About Westbrook Currents</h1>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="story">
        <p>Westbrook is home. I grew up here. Life and my time in the military took me to a lot of places, but I always knew where I wanted to end up. I came back, and I plan to stay in Westbrook for the rest of my life.</p>
        <p>Our city has so much going on, and so many neighbors who could use a hand now and then. Finding out what’s happening, or where to turn for help, shouldn’t feel like hard work.</p>
        <blockquote>That’s why I started Westbrook Currents: a friendly digital town square for Westbrook, built to grow with the community it serves.</blockquote>
        <h2>Where we’re starting</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Events.</strong> Meetings, markets, music, story times, and neighborhood gatherings, all in one list.</li>
          <li><strong>Get Help.</strong> Plain-language guides to city, community and state programs and services. We’re starting with heat, electricity and food, and adding more topics one at a time, as each one is checked.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This is only the beginning. Westbrook Currents will keep changing to fit what our community needs. If there’s something you wish you could find in one place, tell me.</p>
        <h2>How we keep it honest</h2>
        <p>We aim to present information fairly and accurately, in plain English — and we <strong>don’t endorse political candidates or favor one organization over another based on politics</strong>. Where a topic gets complicated, <strong>we separate the verified facts from anyone’s interpretation, including our own, so you can reach your own conclusion</strong>.</p>
        <p>Every help program shows a link to its official page and the date we last checked it. Programs, phone numbers, and dates change, so please check with the program before you apply. If something looks out of date, let me know and I’ll fix it. We will try very hard to keep all the information current.</p>
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>Westbrook Currents is an <strong>independent, noncommercial</strong> community website — not run by the City of Westbrook or any agency listed here, and <strong>with no commercial or political strings attached</strong>. We’re here to support the local groups already doing good work, and to send people their way.</p>
        <h2>Be part of it</h2>
        <p>Hosting something open to the public? <a href="/submit"><strong>Submit an event</strong></a>. Spotted a mistake, or have an idea? <a href="/feedback"><strong>Send us feedback</strong></a>. You can also write to me at <a href="mailto:WestbrookCurrents@gmail.com?subject=Westbrook%20Currents%20suggestion"><strong>WestbrookCurrents@gmail.com</strong></a>.</p>
        <p class="signoff"><span>— Gerry D.</span></p>
      </div>
      <a class="back-link" href="/">Back to Home</a>
    </article>
  </main>

  <style>
    .about-wrap { width: min(860px, 100%); margin: 0 auto; padding: 44px 24px 20px; }
    .about-content { padding: 38px; border: 1px solid #d8e2e8; border-radius: 6px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 14px 35px #092c430d; }
    .profile-section { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; margin: 0 0 30px; padding: 0 0 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .profile-photo { width: 172px; height: 172px; flex: 0 0 172px; border: 4px solid #82d7ef; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
    .profile-heading p { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--blue); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .profile-heading h1 { margin: 0; color: var(--navy); font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.12; }
    .story { color: #294858; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; }
    .story p { margin: 0 0 18px; }
    .story h2 { margin: 34px 0 10px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3; }
    .story ul { margin: 0 0 18px; padding-left: 22px; }
    .story li { margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .story blockquote { margin: 32px 0; padding: 22px 24px; border-left: 6px solid var(--blue); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; color: var(--navy); background: #e6f3f8; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.5; }
    .signoff { margin-top: 34px !important; color: var(--blue); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.5 !important; }
    .signoff span { display: inline-block; font-size: 23px; }
    .back-link { display: block; margin-top: 28px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 4px; color: #fff; background: var(--blue); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; }
    .back-link:hover { background: #066b8e; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .about-wrap { padding: 22px 12px 12px; }
      .about-content { padding: 24px 18px; }
      .profile-section { flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; text-align: center; }
      .profile-photo { width: 148px; height: 148px; flex-basis: 148px; }
      .profile-heading h1 { font-size: 28px; }
      .story { font-size: 15px; }
      .story blockquote { margin: 26px 0; padding: 16px 18px; font-size: 18px; }
    }
  </style>
</SiteLayout>
